Package: dcim
Version: 3.2.2
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DCIM Packaging <support@example.com>
Depends: systemd
Recommends: mysql-server | mariadb-server, nginx
Description: DCIM Dashboard - Data Center Infrastructure Management
 Offline-capable DCIM web application (Node.js/Express + MySQL/MariaDB).
 Installs as a systemd service. After installing this package, run
 `sudo dcim-setup` to complete first-time configuration (database
 connection, port, admin account).
